Spec 12 Part B2 (client procedures per process), B3 (built-in classes per process), B6 (PEB64
fixup before init_user), B7 (procedure handles from 32-bit code), B8 (freed class objects,
bounded class list walk), and the class list per process. The code is in class_ios.h / .inc.

--- a/dlls/win32u/class.c
+++ b/dlls/win32u/class.c
@@ -1,3 +1,5 @@
